<view class="page ai-setting"><view class="intro"><view class="spark">✦</view><view><view>AI 全局设置</view><text>表达偏好与业务背景</text></view></view><view class="section-title">回复风格</view><view class="options card"><view wx:for="{{styles}}" wx:key="*this" class="option" data-key="replyStyle" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="choose"><text>{{item}}</text><view class="radio {{setting.replyStyle===item?'active':''}}"></view></view></view><view class="section-title">称呼方式</view><view class="chips"><view wx:for="{{addresses}}" wx:key="*this" class="chip {{setting.preferredAddress===item?'active':''}}" data-key="preferredAddress" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="choose">{{item}}</view></view><view class="section-title">回复长度</view><view class="chips"><view wx:for="{{lengths}}" wx:key="*this" class="chip {{setting.replyLength===item?'active':''}}" data-key="replyLength" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="choose">{{item}}</view></view><view class="section-title">业务背景</view><view class="form-card"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">我的业务介绍</text><textarea class="small-area" placeholder="例如：专注中高端住宅全屋装修" value="{{setting.businessIntro}}" data-key="businessIntro" bindinput="input" /></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">我的优势</text><textarea class="small-area" placeholder="例如：自有施工团队，报价透明" value="{{setting.businessAdvantage}}" data-key="businessAdvantage" bindinput="input" /></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">我的常用表达</text><textarea class="small-area" placeholder="例如：我再帮您确认一下" value="{{setting.commonExpression}}" data-key="commonExpression" bindinput="input" /></view></view><button class="primary-btn save" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">保存设置</button></view>
